  data: {
    LLM: '1. On your turn, play one card from your hand. 2. Capture: If your card matches a card on the table, you take both. If your card matches the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you take all of them. 3. Priority: You MUST capture a single card of equal value before combining cards. 4. The Hurrikan (Sweep): If your capture leaves the table empty, you score 1 bonus point. 5. If you cannot capture, you must add your card to the table.',
    Player: '1. On your turn, play one card from your hand. 2. Capture: If your card matches a card on the table, you take both. If your card matches the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you take all of them. 3. Priority: You MUST capture a single card of equal value before combining cards. 4. The Hurrikan (Sweep): If your capture leaves the table empty, you score 1 bonus point. 5. If you cannot capture, you must add your card to the table.',
    objective: "Score 16 points by capturing cards and completing 'Hurrikans'.",
    gameplay: '1. On your turn, play one card from your hand. 2. Capture: If your card matches a card on the table, you take both. If your card matches the SUM of multiple cards on the table, you take all of them. 3. Priority: You MUST capture a single card of equal value before combining cards. 4. The Hurrikan (Sweep): If your capture leaves the table empty, you score 1 bonus point. 5. If you cannot capture, you must add your card to the table.',
    keyRules: [
      'You MUST capture a single card of equal value before combining cards',
      'The Hurrikan (Sweep): capturing all cards from the table scores 1 bonus point',
      'Scoring: Most cards (1 pt), Most Hearts (1 pt), Seven of Hearts (1 pt), Each Hurrikan (1 pt)',
      'First to 16 points wins the match',
